--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Design and prior art we studied, reused ideas from, or interoperate with
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The ControlX Passport format deliberately mirrors the section language of
Context Passport so that documents remain mutually ingestible.

  context-passport (macio-arruda)     handoff document sections:
                                      decisions / open questions / resume prompt
  vaultex (jysnctcutn)                local markdown vault exposed over MCP
  opencontext (slxca)                 markdown-first context store
  local-memory-mcp (ptobey)           local-first MCP memory server
  memside (memside)                   cross-tool memory hub
  Agent-Mind-Bridge (brendanlucas01)  agent-to-agent context bridging
  ContextVolt (Rithvickkr)            conversation capture -> continue prompt
  cross-llm-mcp (JamesANZ)            multi-LLM calls from a single process
  k9s / lazygit / btop                dense keyboard-first terminal console UX

No source code from the projects in the second list is vendored into this
repository. If that changes, the vendored code will live under third_party/
with its original license header intact and will be listed here.
